{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月になりましたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/01/7038031/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近\nモバメだけの日々ですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日、舞台稽古です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書くことが無いと言えば無い！\\( Ö )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日いろいろ学びます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お稽古は\nみんなそれぞれお仕事があったりで\n人数が集まらない日もあったりするけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういう日は\n逆にたくさん教えてもらえるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん\n難しいけど頑張ります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張るしかない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/01/7038031/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/01/7038031/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽天ショウタイムで\n乃木坂浪漫が配信されてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/01/7038031/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田がブログを書いてなかった間に\n配信されていました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボブ厨のみなさんは見ると思いますが\n今の中田が好きだって思ってくださる方も\n是非この機会に見てみてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/01/7038031/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝説のカムパネルラとか\n聞けちゃうかもね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショットもあるらしい！！\nこれは初公開！\n中田も見たことない！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/01/7038031/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『花』、『鳥』、『風』、『月』の\n4つに分かれて収録されてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の出演させてもらった\n3作品はどれに入ってるんだろーか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で！で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"配信を記念しまして\nイベント開催決定しました～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/01/7038031/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朗読とトークショーだって！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応募対象期間は6月12日(金) までです＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://video.rakuten.co.jp/content/144607/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}